WEBVTT

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:02.516
and my ability to communicate
clearly face-to-face.

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:05.816
Recorded caller 2: Working from home
has been a nightmare.

00:05:05.840 --> 00:05:08.336
AG: Interruptions have
become a fact of life.

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:10.296
We're all "BBC Dad" now,

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:13.842
with kids or pets dancing
right into our video conferences.

00:05:13.866 --> 00:05:16.649
Recorded caller 3:
We get on a Zoom call with our region,

00:05:16.673 --> 00:05:19.406
and in runs my four-year-old,
completely naked,

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:21.657
and I was speaking, so I wasn't on mute,

00:05:21.681 --> 00:05:24.396
and all you hear is me screaming, "No!"

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:26.805
Recorded caller 4:
I finally made a rule that said,

00:05:26.829 --> 00:05:30.406
"If you interrupt a Zoom meeting,
you'll have to stay for the whole thing."